<title>NETHERLANDS: Delft In details 1996 stock dividend.</title>
<headline>Delft In details 1996 stock dividend.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Delft Instruments said on Friday it had set its 1996 optional final stock dividend at one new share per 52 held.</p>
<p>In March, Delft Instruments announced it would pay a 1996 cash dividend of 0.70 guilders.</p>
<p>Delft Instruments shares closed at 34.80 guilders on the Amsterdam Stock Exchange on Thursday.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000 (fax +31 20 504 5040)</p>
